tools.description:
Stats & fantasy projections

Use for game projections and matchup analysis: projected score distributions, means, and homeWinProbability. Projection types are spread (home-team scoring margin: positive means home projected ahead), total, homeScore, and awayScore. Defaults to all available percentiles. Label projections as estimates; the projected margin equals home score minus away score.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__optimal_sports_projections_get_game_projections(args: {
  // Event UUID (use get_events to find)
  event_id: string;
  // Which percentiles to return. Defaults to all.
  percentiles?: Array<"p1" | "p5" | "p10" | "p25" | "p50" | "p75" | "p90" | "p95" | "p99">;
  // Filter to specific projection type: spread, total, homeScore, awayScore
  projection_type?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ results: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };
```

Stats & fantasy projections

Use for sports stats, recent player performance, and historical context for fantasy sports comparisons. Returns a player's game-by-game stats, opponents, dates, and scores, newest first. Optionally filter by season. First resolve player_id with search_players. Defaults to 20 games; maximum 100.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__optimal_sports_projections_get_player_gamelogs(args: {
  // Max results, 1–100 (default 20)
  limit?: number;
  // Player UUID (use search_players to find)
  player_id: string;
  // Season filter, e.g. "2025"
  season?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ results: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };
```

Stats & fantasy projections

Use for player projections, fantasy sports research, and comparisons of projected player performance and upside. Without player_id, returns all players (up to 100), defaulting to p50. With player_id, returns one player's full available projections. Select percentiles to control detail. Omit prop_type to discover available statistic types in the projections. Label the returned projections as estimates.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__optimal_sports_projections_get_player_projections(args: {
  // Event UUID (use get_events to find)
  event_id: string;
  // Which percentiles to return. Defaults to ["p50"] without player_id, all with player_id.
  percentiles?: Array<"p1" | "p5" | "p10" | "p25" | "p50" | "p75" | "p90" | "p95" | "p99">;
  // Player UUID — omit to get all players in the game
  player_id?: string;
  // Filter to a statistic type; omit to discover available types in the projections
  prop_type?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ results: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };
```

Stats & fantasy projections

Find players by name, league, team, or position. Returns player IDs, team IDs, and injury status. Use before retrieving player stats or projections. Defaults to 25 results; maximum 100.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codex_apps__optimal_sports_projections_search_players(args: {
  // League code, e.g. "nba", "nfl"
  league?: string;
  // Max results, 1–100 (default 25)
  limit?: number;
  // Position filter
  position?: string;
  // Partial name match
  query?: string;
  // Team abbreviation, e.g. "bos"
  team?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult<{ results: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };
```
